  <h1>Lesson 8: Div & Span in HTML</h1>
  <p>Learn How to Group Content with div, span, class and id | LearnHTMLCSSJS.com</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="tabs">
    <button id="lessonTabBtn" class="tab-btn active" onclick="showLesson()">📖 Lesson</button>
